<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= guild.name %> · Velora X1</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script defer src="/dashboard.js"></script></head><body><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark">V</span> VELORA <b>X1</b></a><div><a href="/dashboard">All servers</a><span class="user"><%= user.username %></span><form method="post" action="/auth/logout" class="inline"><button class="link-button">Logout</button></form></div></nav><main class="dashboard"><a href="/dashboard" class="back">← All servers</a><p class="eyebrow">SERVER CONFIGURATION</p><h1><%= guild.name %></h1><% if(saved){ %><p class="success">Settings saved successfully.</p><% } %><% if(built){ %><p class="success">Created <%= built %> roles.</p><% } %><div class="settings-layout"><aside class="settings-nav"><a href="#general">General</a><a href="#logging">Logging</a><a href="#security">Security</a><a href="#help-menu">Help menu</a><a href="#builder">Role builder</a><a href="#commands">Commands</a></aside><div class="settings-content"><form class="panel settings-form" method="post" action="/dashboard/<%= guild.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><section id="general"><p class="eyebrow">01 / GENERAL</p><h2>Server preferences</h2><label>Prefix<input name="prefix" maxlength="5" value="<%= settings.prefix %>" required></label><label>Welcome channel<select name="welcome_channel_id"><option value="">Not configured</option><% channels.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>" <%= settings.welcome_channel_id===c.id?'selected':'' %>>#<%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Welcome message<textarea name="welcome_message" rows="2"><%= settings.welcome_message %></textarea><small>Use {user} and {server} placeholders.</small></label></section><section id="logging"><p class="eyebrow">02 / LOGGING</p><h2>Choose log settings</h2><label>Main log channel<select name="log_channel_id"><option value="">Not configured</option><% channels.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>" <%= settings.log_channel_id===c.id?'selected':'' %>>#<%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><div class="toggle-grid"><% [['log_messages','Message logs'],['log_server','Server logs'],['log_channels','Channel logs'],['log_mod','Moderator command logs'],['log_punishments','Punishment logs'],['log_members','Join/leave logs'],['log_invites','Invite logs'],['log_images','Deleted image logs']].forEach(([key,label])=>{ %><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="<%= key %>" <%= settings[key]?'checked':'' %>><span><%= label %></span></label><% }) %></div><p class="tiny">This starter sends supported events to the main selected log channel; separate per-category channels are not yet implemented.</p></section><section id="security"><p class="eyebrow">03 / SECURITY</p><h2>Guardrails</h2><label>BallDex watcher channel<select name="balldex_channel_id"><option value="">Not configured</option><% channels.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>" <%= settings.balldex_channel_id===c.id?'selected':'' %>>#<%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="anti_raid" <%= settings.anti_raid?'checked':'' %>><span>Join-spike alerts (8+ joins in 15 seconds)</span></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="anti_nuke" <%= settings.anti_nuke?'checked':'' %>><span>Enable anti-nuke monitoring flag</span></label><p class="tiny">Anti-nuke is a monitoring foundation, not a guarantee or full rollback system.</p></section><button class="btn" type="submit">Save settings</button></form><section id="help-menu" class="panel help-sort"><p class="eyebrow">04 / CUSTOMIZE</p><h2>Help menu order</h2><p>Drag categories to arrange your help menu. Changes save when you release a category.</p><ul id="help-order" data-guild="<%= guild.id %>" data-csrf="<%= csrfToken %>"><% order.forEach(c=>{ %><li draggable="true"><span class="drag">⠿</span><span><%= c %></span><small>Drag to move</small></li><% }) %></ul><p id="sort-status" class="tiny">Ready to reorder.</p></section><section id="builder" class="panel builder"><p class="eyebrow">05 / SERVER BUILDER</p><h2>Build a role system</h2><p>Each line becomes a separate role with a category symbol.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%= guild.id %>/builder"><input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Role category<select name="role_type"><option>Community</option><option>Region</option><option>Gender</option><option>Age</option><option>Color</option></select></label><label>Role names (one per line)<textarea name="role_names" rows="5" placeholder="Afghanistan&#10;United Arab Emirates&#10;Other"></textarea></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Create roles</button></form><p class="tiny">Requires Manage Roles; the bot's highest role must be above the roles it creates.</p></section><section id="commands" class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">06 / COMMAND LIBRARY</p><h2>Command inventory</h2><p>100 slash command definitions and 150 prefix entries are included. Some catalog entries are informational stubs and need specialized handlers before production use.</p><a class="btn secondary" href="/invite">Invite Velora X1</a></section></div></div></main></body></html>
